  "mn137:8.1": "Also at <a href='https://suttacentral.net/mn140/en/sujato#10.1'>MN 140:10.1</a>, <a href='https://suttacentral.net/sn36.22/en/sujato#2.15'>SN 36.22:2.15</a>, and <a href='https://suttacentral.net/an3.61/en/sujato#12.1'>AN 3.61:12.1</a>. Outside of this context, <i lang='pi' translate='no'>upavicāra</i> is only found in <a href='https://suttacentral.net/an6.52/en/sujato'>AN 6.52</a>, where women are “preoccupied” with adornments and thieves are “preoccupied” with a hiding place. ",
